</span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<span class=\"jkey-title\">Location</span> <span class=\"jkey-info\"><a href=\"/jobs-location/lagos\">Lagos</a></span>\n</li>\n<li>\n<span class=\"jkey-title\">Job Field</span> <span class=\"jkey-info\"><a href=\"/jobs-by-field/information-technology\">ICT / Computer</a>&nbsp;</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"job-details\">\n<p><strong>Requirement:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor\'s degree in Computer Science&nbsp;or a related field.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mag-b bm-t-20 bm-b-20\">\n<div id=\"adbox\">\n\n<ins data-full-width-responsive=\"true\" data-ad-format=\"auto\" data-ad-slot=\"4400994352\" data-ad-client=\"ca-pub-0011597892009729\" style=\"display:block\" class=\"adsbygoogle\"></ins>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"mag-b ts-18 bm-t-0 bm-b-5\" style=\"margin-top:10px; color: #069;\" id=\"application-method\"><b>Method of Application </b></h2>\n<div class=\"mag-b bm-b-30\">\n<p>Send in your CVs to <strong>careers@saladafrica.com</strong></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"clear:both; color:  #960\">\n<b>Build your CV for free.</b> <a href=\"/cv\">Download in different templates.</a>\n</p>','https://jobs.techstars.com/companies/salad/jobs/28534823-mobile-software-engineer-at-salad-africa-techstars-22#content','startups\ncorporations\ncommunities\ninvestors\nmission','https://cdn.getro.com/companies/0ec34884-bc49-5362-ae52-1d58e7fb910f-1748222618','Salad','https://www.myjobmag.com/job/mobile-software-engineer-salad-africa-techstars-22?utm_source=Techstars+job+board&utm_medium=getro.com&gh_src=Techstars+job+board','Mobile Software Engineer at Salad Africa (Techstars 22)'),(472,0,'<div> <div>We are seeking a highly skilled and motivated full stack Engineer to join our growing team.</div> <div>The ideal candidate will have a strong understanding of web development technologies, a passion for creating high-quality user experiences, and a proven track record of delivering complex projects on-time and on-budget.</div> <div>Level: Mid-Senior (&gt;= 3 years experience); Location: Fully remote (+/- CEST timezone)</div> <div>Tech stack: ReactJs + Typescript + TailwindCss + Java + Spring Boot + Docker + AWS + Mysql</div> <div> <div>The Opportunity:</div> <div><ul> <li> <span>Develop, maintain and optimize web applications + super cool greenfield new projects.</span><ul> <li>Latest tech and framework versions.</li> <li>New AI / ML projects: LLM, regression, Vector dbs.</li> <li>Exciting infra work, scale with queues, CI/CD tools, AWS ecs / ses / ...</li> <li>Rust lighting speed micro-services projects.</li> <li>And tons of brand new prod features.</li> </ul> </li> <li>Work closely with UX/UI designers to ensure that designs are translated into high-quality user experiences.</li> <li>Collaborate with cross-functional teams including other engineers, product managers, and designers to drive projects from concept to launch.</li> <li>Ensure that the code you write is maintainable, testable, and scalable.</li> <li>Participate in code reviews and ensure that code quality standards are maintained.</li> <li>Stay up-to-date with the latest industry trends and technologies.</li> </ul></div> </div> <div> <div>Requirements</div> <div><ul> <li>Bachelor\'s degree in Computer Science or related field, or equivalent experience.</li> <li>Minimum 3 years working experience in Software development.</li> <li>Proven previous experience with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Java, ReactJs, Typescript, Tailwindcss (as a plus), Spring Boot, Git, Mysql.</li> <li>SQL deep knowledge. Be able to design and query at scale.</li> <li>Familiarity with modern build tools such as Webpack, Babel and Gradle.</li> <li>Understanding of cross-browser compatibility issues and ways to work around them.</li> <li>Designing and implementing RESTful APIs.</li> <li>Optimizing the performance of applications for full-scale production deployments.</li> <li>Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail.</li> <li>Excellent written and verbal communication skills.</li> <li>A passion for creating high-quality user experiences.</li> <li>AWS, Docker, Linux, ML/AI as a plus.</li> <li>Good English written and verbal communication skills.</li> </ul></div> </div> <div> <div>You’ll get</div> <div><ul> <li>Close alignment with the CTO.</li> <li>Early company employee.</li> <li>Health plan.</li> <li>30 days annual leave.</li> <li>Fully pumped laptop.</li> <li>Flexible hours.</li> <li>Work WHERE-YOU-WANT policy.</li> </ul></div> </div> <div> <div>Location</div> <div>FULLY REMOTE, within (more or less) CEST timezone</div> </div> <div>Send your CV at: <span>contact AT dealpad.io</span> </div> </div>','https://jobs.techstars.com/companies/dealpad/jobs/27973113-full-stack-engineer-mid-senior#content','startups\ncorporations\ncommunities\ninvestors\nmission','https://cdn.getro.com/companies/997e5d63-0349-5917-9ca6-8ef9a6ba905a-1748137144','dealpad','https://www.dealpad.io/careers-fullstack-engineer?utm_source=Techstars+job+board&utm_medium=getro.com&gh_src=Techstars+job+board','Full stack engineer (Mid-Senior)'),(473,0,'<p><strong>About GlossGenius</strong></p><p><span>GlossGenius is building an ecosystem enabling entrepreneurs to succeed. We empower small business owners to focus on being creators, not admins, by offering a range of business management tools including booking and scheduling, marketing, analytics, payment processing and much more. </span></p><p><span>Tens of thousands of small business owners have chosen to rely on GlossGenius every day to run their entire set of business operations. With its powerful, intuitive platform, GlossGenius is some part a fintech company, some part an SMB software company, while its vibrant, distinguished brand makes it some part a consumer company.</span></p><p><strong>About the Role</strong></p><p><span>As a Senior Software Engineer, Platform, you are an experienced engineer who can solve technical and business problems faced by the team. You work well through ambiguous problems that require collaboration and coordination with other engineers and teams.</span></p><p><span>At GlossGenius, our Platform Engineering team provides software products, solutions, integrations, cloud infrastructure, and expertise that enable other engineering teams to focus on core development, as we scale to support hundreds of thousands of professionals booking millions of appointments and processing millions of payment transactions. This team focuses on everything from building resilient and robust infrastructure solutions, tooling for developer experience, and enabling more autonomous teams across engineering.</span></p><p><span>This role can be based remotely anywhere in the United States, Canada, or our NYC Office.</span></p><p><strong>What You’ll Do</strong></p><ul> <li><span>Own projects end to end, from design to implementation, managing complexity and working with stakeholders to think through areas such as business impact, reliability, operability, and security.</span></li> <li><span>Collaborate with product managers, product design, or other cross-functional stakeholders on roadmap initiatives, product ideation, and prioritization. Break down epics and projects to consumable size for the team and continuous deployment. </span></li> <li><span>Produce high-quality code that’s easily testable, readable, and accounts for edge cases and errors.</span></li> <li><span>Architect tools, services, and systems using well accepted design patterns to allow for iterative autonomous development and future scaling.</span></li> <li><span>Uphold best practices and high standards for engineering and product quality in addition to mentoring newer team members to do the same.</span></li> <li><span>Participation in on-call rotation and helping to build autonomous teams across engineering.</span></li> </ul><p><strong>What We’re Looking For</strong></p><ul> <li><span>5+ years of experience working with cloud technologies in Platform Engineer, Production Engineer, Cloud Engineer, Site Reliability Engineer, or DevOps equivalent roles</span></li> <li><span>Demonstrated experience working with cloud platforms (AWS, GCP, Azure, etc), having designed, built, and maintained cloud platforms that run highly reliable, web-facing services</span></li> <li><span>Demonstrated experience with infrastructure-as-code principles and development</span></li> <li><span>Knowledge of IP networking, DNS, CDN, load balancing, HTTP, and firewalls</span></li> <li><span>Experience building and maintaining cloud-first monitoring, logging, and alerting infrastructure that support 24/7 enterprise platforms</span></li> <li><span>Experience with container technology using Docker and Kubernetes</span></li> <li><span>Experience writing high quality code in a high level programming language (e.g. Ruby, Go, Java, Rust, Typescript, Python)</span></li> </ul><p><strong>Benefits &amp; Perks</strong></p><ul> <li><span>Flexible PTO</span></li> <li><span>Competitive health &amp; dental insurance options, with premiums partially covered by GG</span></li> <li><span>Fertility and adoption benefits via Carrot and Kindbody</span></li> <li><span>Generous, fully-paid parental leave policy</span></li> <li><span>401k benefit - employees are eligible to contribute starting day 1 of employment</span></li> <li><span>Professional Development - employees receive a yearly stipend for approved learning and educational-related expenses</span></li> <li><span>Pre-tax commuter benefits</span></li> <li><span>Dependent Care FSA</span></li> <li><span>Home office support</span></li> <li><span>Team Bonding opportunities - annual company retreat for entire team, plus virtual events throughout the year</span></li> </ul><p><span>The starting base salary for this role in New York, California, and Washington is between $180,000 - $230,000 + target equity + benefits. The base salary offered is dependent upon many factors including skills, experience, location, and education. The base pay range is subject to change and may be modified in the future. </span></p><p><span>Additionally, this role is currently eligible to participate in GlossGenius’s equity plan as well as a range of health &amp; wellbeing, retirement savings, and other benefits within our total rewards offering.</span></p><p><em><span>In order to enter the NY office or participate in any in-person events, all employees must show proof of vaccination against COVID-19. For those individuals who are unable to be vaccinated, GlossGenius will engage in an interactive process to determine a reasonable accommodation.</span></em></p><p><em><span>At GlossGenius, we celebrate our differences and are committed to creating a workplace where all employees feel supported and empowered to do their best work. We believe this benefits not only our employees but our product, customers, and community as well. GlossGenius is proud to be an Equal Opportunity and Affirmative Action Employer.</span></em></p>','https://jobs.techstars.com/companies/glossgenius-2/jobs/26536061-senior-software-engineer-infrastructure#content','startups\ncorporations\ncommunities\ninvestors\nmission','https://cdn.getro.com/companies/6939586a-4a89-5cfe-9f3c-e9ba8509e70b-1748310065','GlossGenius','https://boards.greenhouse.io/glossgenius/jobs/5615537003?utm_source=Techstars+job+board&utm_medium=getro.com&gh_src=Techstars+job+board','Senior Software Engineer, Infrastructure'),(474,0,'<main><div><div>  <div tabindex=\"0\" aria-multiline=\"true\" aria-label=\"Start typing to edit text\" aria-disabled=\"false\" role=\"textbox\"> <span></span><div>   <div><div><div> <div>   </div>  </div></div></div>  </div> <span></span> </div>   </div></div></main>','https://jobs.techstars.com/companies/veracity-protocol/jobs/26454639-senior-ios-flutter-developer-full-time-remote#content','startups\ncorporations\ncommunities\ninvestors\nmission','https://cdn.getro.com/companies/c04d8b21-2d9f-5a0e-ab52-7e823266344c-1747532172','Veracity Protocol','https://veracity.notion.site/Senior-iOS-Flutter-D