<div>Work on daily trade monitoring and surveillance</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Identify opportunities to enhance the efficiency of trading, AML, and other processes</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Work with the COO to support new and existing projects</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Proactively identify strategic goals that are consistent with and in furtherance of the firm\'s mission statement</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Have regular interactions with key business and product partners.</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div> <h4><span>Within 12 months, you will</span></h4>  </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Be fully integrated into the compliance program</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Oversee key strategic initiatives</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Provide subject matter expertise to key business partners</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Proactively work to identify and mitigate regulatory, legal and reputational risk</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Model Vested\'s cultural values to other team members and employees</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div> <h4><span>What we are seeking</span></h4>  </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Passionate about Fintech</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Driven to learn fast, be creative, and win as a team</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Experience in financial services, with 5+ years of compliance experience in a broker-dealer and/or SEC registered investment advisory environment</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Series 7 required; Series 24 preferred, but needed within 3-6 months of hire date</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Past regulatory experience helpful</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Detail-oriented</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Excellent writing ability</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Self-starter with the ability to work both on one\'s own and as a part of a team in a fast-paced startup environment</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Ability to identify issues, escalate appropriately, and see the problem through to completion</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Experience building out AML/BSA Programs (including building out policies and procedures, conducting AML training, investigation management, SAR filings, and transaction monitoring) based on business needs and risk tolerance</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Ability to communicate clearly and effectively with people in financial and non-financial roles, including Executives</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Ability to influence, challenge, and support senior leadership. Experience balancing cross-functional stakeholders pushing in different directions. This role will reward entrepreneurial and creative problem solvers who approach challenges with curiosity and a solutions-oriented mindset</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div> <h4>Application form</h4>  </div></div> <div><div><div aria-labelledby=\":r4:\" role=\"figure\"><div> <div> <div><div><div><div><div><div><div><div>   </div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <div>   </div> <div><div aria-label=\"Click to view alt text\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"button\" aria-disabled=\"true\">ALT</div></div> </div>  </div></div></div></div> </div></div> </div> <span></span> </div>   </div></div></main>','https://jobs.techstars.com/companies/vested-2/jobs/26393726-compliance-officer#content','startups\ncorporations\ncommunities\ninvestors\nmission','https://cdn.getro.com/companies/c373be0b-fdc6-54dc-b526-5a554523ee55-1748655638','Vested','https://vestedfinance.notion.site/Compliance-Officer-f612e00d15d1402eafa9f8c7c23c7103?pvs=25&utm_source=Techstars+job+board&utm_medium=getro.com&gh_src=Techstars+job+board','Compliance Officer'),(477,0,'<main><div><div>   <div aria-multiline=\"true\" aria-label=\"Start typing to edit text\" aria-disabled=\"true\" role=\"textbox\"> <span></span><div> <div><div>  <div><div><div><div><div><div><div>      </div></div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div>  <div><div><div> <div> <div><div><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"👩🏽‍💻 Page icon\"><div><div> </div></div></div></div></div>  </div> <div><div> <div><h1>DevOps Engineer</h1></div>  </div></div> </div></div></div> <div><div> <div><div><div> <div> <span>Location: </span>Remote</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div> <h4>About Vested</h4>  </div></div> <div><div><div> <div>At Vested, we are reimagining the world of cross-border wealth. We believe that the opportunity to preserve and grow one\'s wealth should be universal, no matter where you are. Our mission is to allow international citizens to diversify their wealth beyond their local markets.</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div><div> <div>We are currently the largest US investing platform for Indian investors. At Vested we believe in constantly challenging the status quo and creating products that people across the world have never had access to. We have just closed our Series A financing round and are looking to rapidly expand our product lines and the number of markets we serve. ​</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div><div>   </div></div></div> <div><div> <h4>About the role</h4>  </div></div> <div><div><div> <div>We are looking for a DevOps engineer with experience building and scaling services in a cloud environment. You will work closely alongside tech team leads and the CTO to identify and establish DevOps practices in the company.</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div><div> <div>You will be responsible for building high performing, stable, and secure infrastructure that is scalable and efficient (e.g. automation, cost-effective solutions), as well as work alongside other technical team leads in training and guiding the team in DevOps practices. This includes:</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Improving CI/CD tooling</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Implementing and improving monitoring and alerting</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Improving security practices</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Building and maintaining highly available systems</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Leading and guiding the team in identifying and implementing new technologies</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Build high-performing web and native applications that are robust and easy to maintain</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Provide technical expertise (e.g. constraints, possibilities) early on in the product ideation and requirements gathering phase</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div><div>   </div></div></div> <div><div> <h4>What we\'re seeking</h4>  </div></div> <div><div><div> <div><span>Experience</span></div>  </div></div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>3+ years in systems/software architecture (relevant technologies, see below)</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>3+ years in DevOps (relevant technologies, see below)</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Experience building high performing, stable, and secure infrastructure that is scalable and efficient</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Experience with the technologies and tools we use: Node.js, React, React Native, Fastify, PostgreSql, AWS (ElastiCache for Redis, Aurora / RDS, S3, Lambda, Elastic Beanstalk, EC2, VPC, SQS, Cognito, IAM, WAF, Route 53, CloudFront, CodePipeline, CloudWatch), GitHub, Postman</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Experience deploying and maintaining a micro-service architecture</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Experience with server-less infrastructure paradigms</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Strong knowledge of AWS</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Strong knowledge of security best practices (relevant experience in fintech preferred)</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div><div>   </div></div></div> <div><div><div> <div><span>Additional qualities</span></div>  </div></div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Ability to understand business requirements and translate them into technical requirements and vice versa</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Ability to implement, document, and communicate architecture, design decisions, and processes</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>A knack for benchmarking and optimization</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Strong analytical and problem solving skills</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Rock solid at working with third-party dependencies and debugging dependency conflicts</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Ability to implement feedback, learn quickly, and contribute new ideas</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>A proactive mindset and independent problem solver</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>A constant learner (we are a fast growing start-up and want you to grow with us!)</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>A strong team player with strong verbal and written communication</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>A self-motivator and entrepreneurial spirit with unrelenting passion to deliver the best service possible and is willing to come up with solutions by diving deep into the core of the problem - this role will reward entrepreneurial and creative problem solvers who approach challenges with curiosity and a solutions-oriented mindset</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div><div>   </div></div></div> <div><div> <h4>What we offer</h4>  </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>The opportunity to build and put in new design system for a global financial product in a fast-growing company, and supercharge existing processes and structures.</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Competitive salary and stock options.</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Flexibility in career possibilities that allow you to grow with Vested. As a fast growing startup, you will have the opportunity to wear multiple hats across the product team.</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>We operate as a distributed team. You will have the flexibility to work remotely. That said, we have US team members in Denver, San Francisco, and Toronto.</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Talented and motivated team members who care deeply about one another, our mission and our customers.</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>The rare opportunity to punch a hole in the universe.</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div><div> <div>Vested is proud to be an equal opportunity employer and values diversity at our company. We do not discriminate based on race, color, national origin, ethnicity, religion or religious belief, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, military or veteran status, disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div> <h4>Application form</h4>  </div></div> <div><div><div aria-labelledby=\":r4:\" role=\"figure\"><div> <div> <div><div><div><