om you.</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div><div>   </div></div></div> <div><div><div> <div>Responsibilities:</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Develop and execute strategies to grow and engage our developer community around Web3, DAOs, and NFTs</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Collaborate with our engineering team to understand our technology stack, products, and services, effectively communicating their value to developers</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Organize and participate in events, webinars, and meetups to showcase Coherent\'s technology and build relationships with developers</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Create developer-focused content (tutorials, guides, blog posts, etc.) that showcases the capabilities of our platform and helps developers get started quickly</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Provide feedback and insights from the community to our product and engineering teams, helping to shape the direction of our platform</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Identify and build partnerships with key influencers, organizations, and developers in the Web3 ecosystem</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div><div>   </div></div></div> <div><div><div> <div>Requirements:</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Proven experience in building and managing developer communities, preferably in the Web3 space</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Strong knowledge of Web3, DAOs, and NFTs, and their underlying technologies and protocols</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Excellent communication skills, with the ability to convey complex technical concepts in a clear and concise manner</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Experience creating developer-focused content such as tutorials, guides, and blog posts</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Strong networking skills and a passion for engaging with developers and the broader Web3 community</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Willingness to be a public-facing advocate for Coherent and our mission</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div><div>   </div></div></div> <div><div><div> <div>Nice to have:</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Experience working with or contributing to open source projects</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Technical background or experience as a software engineer</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Previous experience working in a fast-paced startup environment</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div><div>   </div></div></div> <div><div><div> <div>To apply, please email your resume, a brief introduction about yourself and your experience in the Web3 space, and any relevant links to your work (GitHub, blog, etc.) to carl@coherent.xyz</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div><div>   </div></div></div> <div><div><div> <div>At Coherent, we believe in fostering a diverse and inclusive work environment, and we\'re committed to building a team that represents a variety of backgrounds, perspectives, and skills. We\'re excited to hear from you and learn what you can bring to our rapidly growing community.</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div><div>   </div></div></div> </div></div> </div> <span></span> </div>  </div></div>','https://jobs.techstars.com/companies/coherent-api-2/jobs/26387176-lead-developer-advocate-web3-daos-nfts-new-york#content','startups\ncorporations\ncommunities\ninvestors\nmission','https://cdn.getro.com/companies/78040979-04d6-5bbb-9bd9-04b381559097-1749776719','Coherent API','https://coherent-pages.notion.site/Lead-Developer-Advocate-Web3-DAOs-NFTs-New-York-558d1e4ffee9400ab9b84bd705be6d3f?pvs=25&utm_source=Techstars+job+board&utm_medium=getro.com&gh_src=Techstars+job+board','Lead D