pply</div> </div></div></div></div></div> <div role=\"cell\"><div><div><div>  <div><a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" role=\"link\" href=\"#\">jobs@hello-birdie.com</a></div> </div></div></div></div> </div></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <div><div> <div><div> <h2>What we\'re looking for</h2>  </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div> <span>👩‍💻</span>- You have 2 to 5 years of experience as a full-stack developer or data-engineer. You worked on high-growth projects on any AWS or GCP Cloud.</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div> <span>📈</span>- With the help of the founders, you understanding of the business problem the software is solving and you are focused on analytics and reliability : KPIs, logs, boards.</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div> <span>🤓</span>- You are fluent with different languages both in front-end and back-end (such as PHP, Python). On top, you have experience with frameworks such as Symfony/Laravel, Django or similar.</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div> <span>🧠</span>- You understand how to build predictive pipelines and models that empowers business value, and have experience with an ML framework such as TensorFlow, PyTorch or SciKit Learn</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div> <span>🎨</span>- You like the beauty of a nice algorithm or a great software architecture. You like to think that your code is a piece of art.</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div> <span>🚢</span>- You are very organized, and know how to work with Git on a daily basis, with a great sense for setting up branches with the team<span>.</span> </div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div> <span>🐜</span>- You don\'t like to maintain code or servers manually, that\'s why you like unit tests and continuous integration.</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div> <span>🍻</span>- You are a good with communications with the team and with other experts in the field. You like to participate in conferences or meetups. </div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div> <span>🏆</span>- You would like to work in a sports business environment. If you don\'t know anything about golf that\'s not a problem. But if you like it, it\'s a great plus!</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div> <h2>Responsibilities</h2>  </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Provides technical leadership to the whole team, delivering a vision for work requirements in order to reach the company objectives</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Own the technical scope of sprints in an agile process, and manage priorities, deadlines and deliverables</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Ensure the effective performance of product, and take proactive actions to identify and resolve issues before they impact users</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Lead the engineering design of new features, with a team involving mobile developers and data-scientists</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Produce your own code, to implement new features into our mobile or web apps</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Maintain APIs and cloud infrastructure</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Mentor other team members on design techniques, and conduct technical assessments</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Maintain a sufficient technical documentation</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div> <h2>Qualifications</h2>  </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Proven experience on web and mobile-based developments in a team-work environment</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Languages : Python / PHP / HTML-CSS-JS</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Clouds : AWS (EC2, S3, API GW, Lambda), GCP (Firebase)</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Professional English needed, French is a plus </div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Computer Science degree is a plus</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div> <h2>Benefits</h2>  </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>50-75 kEUR+ (depending on experience) + Equity</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Free table tennis, fitness, and golf</div>  </div></div> </div></div> <div><div> <h2>About Us</h2>  </div></div> <div><div><div> <div>Hello Birdie is a start-up very comfortably installed in a stadium, in Paris (16th), and in Annecy (Haute-Savoie).</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div><div> <div>Hello Birdie is a smart caddie to help golfers perform better by playing smarter.</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div><div> <div>We believe data can change the game of golf. Adjusting strategy on a golf course can bring performance, but also more fun ! </div>  </div></div></div> <div><div><div> <div>Our mobile app is already being used by tens of thousands of golfers, in France and in Europe, and we observe a very fast growth on our products and services. Our technology uses predictive analytics (Data Science and Artificial Intelligence) in order to propose a better course management, according to the players real capabilities, and to the current weather conditions. Like a golf \"caddie\", the personal assistant to help golfers all along his golf game.</div>  </div></div></div> <div><div><div> <div> <span>The job can be either in </span><span>Paris</span><span> (Le Tremplin, Porte de Saint-Cloud, Paris 16e) - </span><span>or</span><span> in </span><span>Annecy</span><span> (if you are an outdoor person this is the greatest place to be).</span> </div>  </div></div></div> <div><div> <h2>How to Apply</h2>  </div></div> <div><div><div> <div>3 easy steps to<span> get that job :</span> </div>  </div></div></div> <div><div>  <div><div> <div>Phone interview</div>  </div></div>