  background-image: url(\"https://images.teamtailor-cdn.com/images/s3/teamtailor-production/hero_picture_medium-v6/image_uploads/e41ce6f0-5971-4c88-87b0-32b79ec3824d/original.jpeg\");\n      }\n    }\n\n    @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {\n      .block-cover--with-background {\n        background-image: url(\"https://images.teamtailor-cdn.com/images/s3/teamtailor-production/hero_picture_large_full_cover-v6/image_uploads/e41ce6f0-5971-4c88-87b0-32b79ec3824d/original.jpeg\");\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n\n\n<section data-careersite--jobs--form-overlay-target=\"cover\" data-controller=\"blocks--cover--default\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF !important\" class=\"block-cover w-full bg-cover sm:bg-fixed bg-center bg-company-secondary-fallback text-company-secondary pb-20 pt-[160px] lg:pt-20 lg:h-screen lg:min-h-[650px] block-cover--with-background relative\">\n    <div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-full px-4 text-lg text-center z-career-block-content h-full\">\n  <div class=\"relative md:max-w-[75%] w-full\">\n    <div class=\"w-full mb-8 text-sm font-bold tracking-widest text-center uppercase\">\n      <span>R&amp;D</span>\n\n  <span class=\"mx-[2px]\">·</span>\n\n    <span>R&amp;D Center, Poland</span>\n\n\n    </div>\n    <h1 style=\"hyphens: inherit;\" data-controller=\"fit-title\" class=\"font-company-header text-[35px] md:text-6xl lg:text-[72px] leading-tight\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; font-size: 72px;\" class=\"textFitted\">Ruby on Rails Engineer</span></h1>\n    <h2 class=\"block mt-2 sm:text-xl leading-normal\">Want to change the financial world for the better?\n\nBecome part of the goscore team!</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"mt-10\">\n      \n  <button data-careersite--jobs--form-overlay-target=\"coverButton\" data-action=\"click->careersite--jobs--form-overlay#showFormOverlay\" class=\"careersite-button min-w-[220px] group min-w-[220px] bg-opacity-100\" role=\"button\">\n  <span class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-x-3\">\n    \n    <span class=\"truncate\">SEIZE THIS OPPORTUNITY</span>\n  </span>\n</button>\n\n\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>  \n    <button title=\"Scroll to content\" data-action=\"click->blocks--cover--default#handleScrollDown\" class=\"hidden lg:block z-career-block-content absolute hover:opacity-75 rounded-full bottom-10 left-half transform -translate-x-1/2 focus-visible-company-secondary\">\n      <svg data-fa-i2svg=\"\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" data-icon=\"circle-chevron-down\" data-prefix=\"fal\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-circle-chevron-down text-[48px] w-12 h-12\"><path d=\"M356.7 212.7L256 313.4L155.3 212.7c-6.25-6.25-16.38-6.25-22.62 0s-6.25 16.38 0 22.62l112 112C247.8 350.4 251.9 352 256 352s8.188-1.562 11.31-4.688l112-112c6.25-6.25 6.25-16.38 0-22.62S362.9 206.4 356.7 212.7zM256 0C114.6 0 0 114.6 0 256s114.6 256 256 256s256-114.6 256-256S397.4 0 256 0zM256 480c-123.5 0-224-100.5-224-224s100.5-224 224-224s224 100.5 224 224S379.5 480 256 480z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg>\n</button></section>\n\n      <section class=\"pt-20 pb-12 block-px company-links\">\n  <div data-controller=\"careersite--responsive-video\" class=\"mx-auto max-w-[750px] prose font-company-body overflow-hidden break-words\">\n    <p><em>At goscore, we’re creating the foundations that a new world of finance will be built on. By constantly challenging ourselves to go further and do better, we’re developing the ground-breaking services that businesses will use, to revolutionise the way millions of people manage their money. The world of financial services is changing fast, and we will continue to be at the forefront of it.</em><em></em></p>\n<p><em>Goscore is a place where talented people work together to create a productive, fun environment. With us, you’ll get the space to develop yourself further and deepen your knowledge of new technologies with exciting solutions from such fields as Big Data, ML, BI.<br></em></p>\n<p><em>Our R&amp;D Team accommodates passionate of bleeding-edge technologies &amp; a flexible approach to implementing programming projects.<br>Depending on the needs, we use Python, Ruby, Go &amp; we strongly focus on cloud technologies like AWS, Docker, K8s, and more. We value and apply the best programming practices, friendly code reviews, and a continuous learning approach. We\'re experienced specialists, always ready to give you a helping hand!</em><em><br></em></p>\n<hr>\n<p>As a result of continued growth, we are looking to recruit several Ruby on Rails Engineers&nbsp;to join our tech talented team.</p>\n<p><strong>As a Ruby on Rails Engineer</strong>, you will be part of driving the change in how everyone perceives banking and financial services for the better. We are looking for people who want to have an impact. In your team, at goscore, in the industry.<br>Engineering at goscore is also an inspirational group, where knowledge sharing and learning from each other is part of the culture to encourage everyone to develop and progress themselves.<strong><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong>TL;DR</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Opportutnity to change the world</li>\n<li>Supportive team</li>\n<li>Big challenges</li>\n<li>Work&nbsp;at the office (primarily)</li>\n<li>Competitive wage:&nbsp;PLN 12,000 - 22,000 (B2B)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Main job responsibilities:</strong><br></p>\n<ul> <li>building and designing secure, scalable, and reliable microservices in a cloud SaaS environment;</li> <li>building products from the ground up. Taking an idea and making it a reality;</li> <li>thinking out of the box to come up with a solution to problems that do not seem to have one;</li> <li>trying new technologies and applying them if they make sense and solve real problems;</li> <li>owning technical design for projects of moderate complexity, and understanding the tradeoffs in creating good software in their area;</li> <li>collaborating and build high-quality products by following good engineering practices;</li> <li>designing technical documentation;</li> <li>mentoring and supporting people within the team/organization.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>We are looking for people who have the following skills and abilities:</strong></p>\n<ul> <li>at least 2 years of experience as a Ruby / Ruby on Rails Developer;</li> <li>experience working in Cloud or other large scalable environments;</li> <li>understanding of best practices in RESTful APIs design;</li>\n<li>experience in working with Agile methodologies like Scrum;</li> <li>knowledge of SQL, NoSQL&nbsp;and other database architectures.</li> </ul>\n<p>Nice to have:</p>\n<ul> <li>knowledge and interest in security, identity, access management, or authentication;</li>\n<li>able to be productive in multiple languages: Python / Flask, Javascript / NodeJS;</li> <li>BSc in Computer Science or related field.&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><strong>We expect that you will:</strong></p>\n<ul> <li>be an organized, accountable, responsible, and strong individual contributor who works well with minimal supervision;</li> <li>be self-motivated, self-reliant, resourceful, and communicative. You speak up, respectfully, when you see an opportunity to try things in a different way to support business objectives;</li> <li>speak fluent English.</li> </ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>As a part of our friendly team, you’ll get:</strong></p>\n<ul> <li>an insanely supportive team, working to build great products and make delegation simpler and easier for everyone;</li> <li>an&nbsp;opportunity to change the world 😊;</li> <li>a&nbsp;comfortable place at the office with tasty coffee and fruits;</li> <li>an&nbsp;ability to work in the office and at home;</li> <li>an&nbsp;additional educational options;</li>\n<li>a&nbsp;competitive wage on the market of PLN&nbsp;12,000 - 22,000 (B2B) based on the interview</li> <li>an option to get&nbsp;employed as B2B.</li> </ul>\n<p><br>We offer the opportunity to be at the forefront of new technology that is transforming the financial sector into a collaborative environment that promotes personal financial awareness.<br></p>\n<p><em>We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.</em><br><em><br></em></p>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n\n    <section class=\"pb-20 block-px\">\n  <div class=\"px-8 mx-auto max-w-[856px] w-full bg-company-primary-text bg-opacity-3 rounded py-12\">\n      <dl class=\"md:max-w-[70%] mx-auto text-md gap-y-5 flex flex-wrap flex-col md:flex-row company-links\">\n          <dt class=\"w-full font-semibold md:w-half\">Department</dt>\n<dd class=\"w-full md:w-half md:ltr:pl-16 md:rtl:pr-16\">\n  \n              R&amp;D\n\n</dd>\n          <dt class=\"w-full font-semibold md:w-half\">Locations</dt>\n<dd class=\"w-full md:w-half md:ltr:pl-16 md:rtl:pr-16\">\n  \n              R&amp;D Center, Poland\n\n</dd>\n\n\n\n\n\n      </dl>\n    \n</div></section>\n\n      <section data-section-model=\"15546412\" data-section-route=\"section\" class=\"block--recruiter bg-company-primary text-company-primary\" style=\"--block-base-text-color: var(--company-primary-text-color);--block-base-link-color: var(--company-link-color);--block-base-background-color: var(--company-primary-bg-color);--block-base-highlight-color: var(--company-color);\" id=\"section-15546412\">\n    \n    <section class=\"mb-15 sm:mb-20 block-px company-links\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center mx-auto sm:flex-row block-max-w--md\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"group-hover:ring-2 group-hover:ring-company-link group-hover:ring-offset-2 group-focus-visible:ring-2 group-focus-visible:ring-company-link group-focus-visible:ring-offset-2 mb-8 md:mb-0 bg-gray-300 relative h-[170px] w-[170px] rounded-full\">\n    <figure class=\"w-full h-full\">\n  <picture>\n  